\title{The tightest-fit rectangle algorithm}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2026-11-24}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{I define an algorithm for solving the rectangle game as follows:}

\ul{
\li{\strong{1.} Given an input #{m} of the total number of samples, first record the outputs of these samples.}
\li{\strong{2.} Draw the smallest possible axis-aligned rectangle that contains all the points (labelled as inside).}
}
